#Requires AutoHotkey v2.0

; =====================================================================
;  Site-specific hotkeys and hotstrings. Copy this file to local.ahk (which
;  git ignores) and fill in your own. Sostenuto includes it if it exists,
;  after app-shortcuts.ahk, so WinHeld() and the call: targets of
;  core\functions.local.ahk are available. The Layers tab lists it like any
;  other layer file.
;
;  Every Win chord should require a PHYSICAL Win key - see the note in
;  app-shortcuts.ahk for why.
; =====================================================================

#HotIf WinHeld()
!#j::LaunchJournal()
!#v::LaunchViewer()
!#i::LaunchIntranet()
+#h::LaunchHelper()
#HotIf

; A hotstring that types a long path
:?*:projdir::SendText(OneDrive("Projects\Current"))
